---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="AC Not Cooling | Wake Forest & Rolesville, NC" description="AC blowing warm air in Wake Forest? Fast diagnosis and repair for systems that won't cool.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC Not Cooling</h1>
      <p>AC blowing warm air in Wake Forest? Fast diagnosis and repair for systems that won't cool.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Warm air from the vents is one of the most common calls we receive. Causes range from simple (dirty filter, thermostat settings) to complex (low refrigerant, failed compressor). We find it and fix it.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full system performance testing</li>
        <li>Refrigerant level check and leak repair</li>
        <li>Coil cleaning and airflow restoration</li>
        <li>Thermostat calibration and replacement</li>
        <li>Honest recommendation: repair vs. replace</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Fast Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day AC service in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and nearby communities. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>